# Secrets and local state never enter an image build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.sensitive_docs
docs
code-agent

# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
**/*.log
